ngl Guess keeps the secret as a value
Guess[s](w, next) vs Silence => next ~ w
Guess[s](w, next) vs g
  if g < s => "Higher\nGuess: " ~ Ask(w, w2, h), h ~ Guess[s](w2, next)
  if g > s => "Lower\nGuess: " ~ Ask(w, w2, h), h ~ Guess[s](w2, next)
  else     => "Chad.\n" ~ Print(w, next)

main
  "Guess: " ~ Ask(world, w, g)
  g ~ Guess[42](w, Ghost)